{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48166","headline":"葬西施挽歌 · 王炎","name":"葬西施挽歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西望吴王国，云书凤字牌。\n连江起珠帐，择地葬金钗。\n满地红心草，三层碧玉阶。\n春风无处所，凄恨不胜怀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王炎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48166.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48166","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}